    "Lo que no está escrito, no se cobra. Entrega en 8 semanas, con fecha firmada.": "What isn't written down isn't charged. Handover in 8 weeks, with a signed date.",
    "Sergi y Laura · Cota Cero": "Sergi and Laura · Cota Cero",
